<title>JAPAN: Toyota Aug domestic output up 7.6% yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Toyota Aug domestic output up 7.6% yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Toyota Motor Corp said its domestic vehicle production, exports, domestic sales and overseas output in August were as follows (with percentage changes from a year earlier):</p>
<p> Production	  203,806   up   7.6 percent</p>
<p>  - Car		164,356   up   9.0 percent</p>
<p>  - Truck &amp; Bus     39,450   up   1.9 percent</p>
<p>---</p>
<p> Exports		92,748   up  25.0 percent</p>
<p>  - Cars		67,917   up  30.3 percent</p>
<p>  - Truck &amp; Bus     24,831   up  12.4 percent</p>
<p>---</p>
<p> Domestic sales    107,544   down 0.5 percent</p>
<p>  - Car		 74,154   up   4.2 percent</p>
<p>  - Truck &amp; Bus     33,390   down 9.5 percent</p>
<p>---</p>
<p> Overseas output    88,273   down 19.8 percent</p>
</text>
